  "body": "### Summary\n\nCapture on the Mac, with the LOT-001 (#38) kit (`tooling/fixtures/`), the page state: Logged-in topic page holding one of the viewer's own posts on a **public** topic (`cat=<forum>`): the toolbar's edit link shape there, and which of MP, favourite (`addflag`) and alert (`modo.php`) links remain on an own post.\n\n### Scope\n\nState to capture: Logged-in topic page holding one of the viewer's own posts on a **public** topic (`cat=<forum>`): the toolbar's edit link shape there, and which of MP, favourite (`addflag`) and alert (`modo.php`) links remain on an own post.\n\nNote: every edit link of the corpus is in a private conversation (RA1–RA4, RU2); read-only GET of a page that already holds a post of the account\n\nRules: anonymize every free-text field; never hand-build the state in the cloud (LESSONS 36); add a legacy oracle when a parser consumes it (LOT-002 (#39)..005 tooling); one PR per batch of captures.\n\n### Wanted by\n\nLOT-031 (#58), spec `docs/lots/LOT-031-message-actions.md` \"Pending capture\" (PR #28)\n\n### Depends on\n\n—\n\n### Owner / session\n\n— (ready; `host: mac`)\n\n### Source\n\nPending capture listed by LOT-031 (PR #28).\n",
